Longyearbyen. Because the permafrost prevents bodies from decomposing, the local cemetery stopped accepting burials in 1950 to prevent the spread of ancient diseases; today, the terminally ill are flown to mainland Norway.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:19:31Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Oh I saw in reel about this one.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:19:47Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Outside of the main settlements, it is legally required to carry a high-powered firearm for protection against polar bears, which are frequent visitors and can technically outnumber humans in the Barents Sea region.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:20:08Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Permafrost is so cool", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:20:14Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Next", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:20:38Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "13. The world's most biodiverse forest sits atop some of the most nutrient-depleted soil on the planet. Its survival depends on a supply chain of continental scale — one that crosses an entire ocean. Each year, prevailing trade winds carry hundreds of millions of tonnes of dust from the world's largest hot desert westward across the Atlantic. The dust is rich in a specific mineral nutrient that the forest's waterlogged, leached soils cannot generate in sufficient quantities locally. It falls across the basin and fertilises the very trees and organisms whose extraordinary diversity it sustains. Remove this annual delivery, and the calculation changes entirely.\nId X (the specific nutrient carried in the dust) and Y", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:20:50Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Amazon", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:20:52Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Phospohorus", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:20:54Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "amazon", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:21:14Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Sorry y is the source of phosphorus", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:21:18Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "For Amazon", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:21:22Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "oh", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:21:23Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "in Chad", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:21:23Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Where it comes from", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T16:21:30Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "some depression it is called", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]